#202122);border:2px solid var(--border-subtle,#8888aa);text-align:left;line-height:1.6}.mw-parser-output .wst-license-container-title{display:inline-block;padding:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .wst-license-container-content{background:transparent;color:inherit;margin:0;padding:3px;text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer.warningLicenseContainer>div:first-child{border:2px solid var(--border-color-error,#b22222);background-color:var(--background-color-error-subtle,#ffeeee);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer.warningLicenseContainer>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:nth-child(2)>div:nth-child(2){border:2px solid var(--border-color-error,#b22222);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}</style><div class=\"licenseContainer licenseBanner dynlayout-exempt\">\n<div><div><div><div>\n<p><span class=\"imageLeft\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/60px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\" /></span></span></span>\n</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<p>此北宋作品在全世界都属于<b><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9C%89%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:公有领域\">公有领域</a></b>，因为作者逝世已经超过100年，且作品于1931年1月1日之前出版。\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p><span class=\"noimageRight\"></span>\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"licensetpl\">\n<p><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;link&#95;req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;attr&#95;req\">false</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">追謚曰元貞皇太后　薛史卷八梁末帝紀及五代會要卷一均無「太」字。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">貞明元年　汲本作「貞明年」，百衲本及其他各本均作「貞明五年」。薛史卷八梁末帝紀、通鑑卷二六九及本卷康王友孜傳均繫于貞明元年。五代會要卷一作「乾化五年」，亦即貞明元年。考異卷六二、纂誤補卷二皆謂「貞明五年」誤。今改。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">領山南西道節度使　「山」，他本均作「嶺」。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">貞明四年友能以陳州兵反　薛史卷一０梁末帝紀及通鑑卷二七一均繫於龍德元年四月。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">太祖外孫袁象先　按薛史卷五九及本史卷四五袁象先傳，象先母為太祖妹萬安大長公主，象先乃太祖甥。</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.eqiad.main‐55798dc59f‐htbgn\nCached time: 20260911205202\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Template:PD‐old (currentyear)\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.125 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.160 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 263/1000000\nRevision size: 15435/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 7178/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 349/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4252/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.053/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 872271/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  134.798      1 -total\n 40.44%   54.510      1 Template:Header2\n 36.02%   48.560      1 Template:北宋作品\n 34.91%   47.053      1 Template:PD-old\n 33.47%   45.118   